---
layout: base.njk
title: The original 123ofnet.com (2000-2005)
description: "Screenshots of the original 123ofnet.com web portal from 2000 to 2005, restored from the Internet Archive."
permalink: /1999/
---
<div class="content">
  <h1>The original <em>123ofnet.com</em></h1>
  <p>"An easy solution to the Net !!!" These are the real pages from 2000&ndash;2005, saved by the
  <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/2001*/123ofnet.com">Internet Archive</a>. Many images were never archived, so you'll see some empty boxes.</p>
  {% for group in museum %}{% if group.shots | length %}
  <h2>{{ group.site }}{% if group.site == "123ofnet.hypermart.net" %} (our free-host home, before the .com launch on 1 Nov 2000){% endif %}</h2>
  <div class="shots">
    {% for s in group.shots %}
    <figure><a href="/1999/shots/{{ s.file }}"><img src="/1999/shots/{{ s.file }}" alt="{{ group.site }} {{ s.page }} page, {{ s.date }}" loading="lazy"></a>
    <figcaption><b>{{ s.page }}</b><br>{{ s.date }} &middot; <a href="https://web.archive.org/web/{{ s.ts }}/{{ s.url }}">archive</a></figcaption></figure>
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
